Package: capitolr
Title: Explore Capitol Corridor Train Status
Version: 0.1.0
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Authors@R:
    person("Yao", "Long", email = "rileyly@berkeley.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Retrieves Capitol Corridor train and station stop information
    from the Amtraker API and returns tidy data frames. Provides tools
    to summarize differences between scheduled and reported arrival times.
